{{Calculator:Twisted bow}}-->

Assuming [[dragon arrow]]s, 99 [[Ranged]], and all damage boosting items and effects, the maximum hit with the twisted bow outside of the [[Chambers of Xeric]], [[Tombs of Amascut]], or [[Nightmare Zone]] is 92 (94 on accurate) on a Slayer task and 88 (90 on accurate) off-task. The absolute max hit possible currently is 109 (111 on accurate), which is possible while attacking a boss inside Chambers of Xeric with 350 magic or higher, while under the influence of an [[Overload (+)]].

